X|*  the screen in a specified orientation and position.	 The form of the   *|
X|*  function is:							   *|
X|*									   *|
X|*	draw_piece (piece_no, orientation, y, x, flag)			   *|
X|*									   *|
X|*  All the arrguments are integers.  Flag is either PD_DRAW or		   *|
X|*  PD_ERASE, specifying the effect of the function.  Piece_no is	   *|
X|*  between 0 and 6 inclusive, and specifies what sort of piece is	   *|
X|*  required.  Orientation is between 0 and 3 inclusive, and states	   *|
X|*  which way up the piece is to be drawn, and y and x express the	   *|
X|*  position as an index into the GAME_DEPTH by GAME_WIDTH array	   *|
X|*  that is the board.							   *|
